@startuml containers
!include _theme.iuml

rectangle "Your machine" as Machine {
  rectangle "Agent process\nreads SKILL.md, calls the CLI" as Agent
  rectangle "Node.js process\nrup.mjs, one run per command" as Node
  database "Skill folder\nSKILL.md, references, templates, editions.json" as SkillDir
  database "Project folder\nrup.config.json and docs/rup" as Project
  rectangle "Docker container\nPlantUML server on 127.0.0.1:8085" as Docker
}

Agent --> SkillDir : reads
Agent --> Node : shell command
Node --> SkillDir : templates, catalogue
Node --> Project : reads and writes
Node --> Docker : HTTP, diagram source
Docker --> Node : SVG
Agent --> Project : writes documents

note bottom of Docker
  Published on the loopback interface only,
  with the SANDBOX security profile.
end note
@enduml
